<div class="bhd-page__keypoints" aria-label="Research principles">
  <div><strong>Status before spin</strong><span>Published, active, planned and exploratory work are labelled differently.</span></div>
  <div><strong>Mechanism is not product proof</strong><span>Physiology can support a question without proving a Best Hydrate outcome.</span></div>
  <div><strong>Claims follow data</strong><span>We update public language as direct evidence develops.</span></div>
</div>

