    <h2>Peer-reviewed hydration review published in Frontiers in Nutrition</h2>
    <p><strong>Revisiting the Need for Innovative Oral Hydration Technologies</strong> was published September 23, 2026 in <em>Frontiers in Nutrition</em>, Sport and Exercise Nutrition, Volume 13.</p>
    <p>The review discusses oral hydration technology across physiology, exercise and health-related contexts. It is scholarly work, not a finished-product efficacy trial.</p>
    <a class="bhd-page__text-link" href="https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/nutrition/articles/10.3389/fnut.2026.1851906/full" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View the Frontiers article →</a>
